# Implementation plan — Spec 1.11.3

## Summary

Fix mouse wheel scrolling on Identity Profile when embedded in WebOnOne core via `PlatformServiceFrame`. Scroll root is `.platform-embed-shell-main` inside `@webonone/platform-embed`.

See [02-profile-embed-scroll-fix.md](./02-profile-embed-scroll-fix.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.11.3` |
| Services | WebOnOne + Identity for manual test |
| Packages | `platform-embed` — dev alias in consumer vite configs |
| New env | None |

---

## Phase 1 — Embed shell wheel scroll

**Goal:** Wheel deltas scroll `.platform-embed-shell-main` in embed iframes.

**Exit criteria:** WebOnOne `/profile` — wheel scrolls profile; type-check passes.

| Task | Paths |
|------|-------|
| Wheel hook | `packages/platform-embed/src/useEmbedMainWheelScroll.ts` |
| Shell wiring | `packages/platform-embed/src/PlatformEmbedShell.tsx` |
| Export | `packages/platform-embed/src/index.ts` |

**Implementation notes:**

- Only active in embed mode (`shouldUsePlatformEmbedCanvas` logic — iframe or `embed=platform` query).
- Use `{ passive: false }` on `wheel`; clamp `scrollTop`; `preventDefault` when delta consumed.
- Normalize `deltaMode` (pixel / line / page).

**Verify:**

```bash
npm run type-check -w @webonone/platform-embed
npm run type-check -w identity-root
npm run type-check -w webonone-v2-root
```

Manual: WebOnOne → Profile → wheel scroll on long profile content.

---

## Cross-service integration

- No JWT, auth-code, or postMessage contract changes.
- Identity `PlatformEmbedLayout` already wraps content in `PlatformEmbedShell` — fix applies automatically.

